[{"title":"读总制宫保洪先生榜文有感蒙枉顾因拜录谢","author":"林光","text":"元元无计避诛求，啸聚湖山可自由。\n万里几微关总制，四藩威武会诸侯。\n兴元诏感山东泣，淮蔡忠孚度相谋。\n大慰中原枯旱望，几番霖雨沛田畴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52495,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少保大司寇总制洪两峰先生见示春日游鸡鸣寺旧作追和奉答二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"寺爱鸡鸣过柳堤，三春风日弄晴晖。\n身登佛塔形如花，心出云霄步欲飞。\n今古英雄留胜迹，寻常治乱起几微。\n夕阳回首乌衣巷，争迓神仙一醉归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52496,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少保大司寇总制洪两峰先生见示春日游鸡鸣寺旧作追和奉答二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"玄武湖边寺可扳，黑龙常见有无间。\n六朝文物空前代，七级浮屠尚此山。\n王气东南元有主，大明日月照区寰。\n先生多少登临兴，富贵浮云视等閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52497,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少保大司寇总制洪两峰先生隆中谒武侯兼承致前美建议立祠之意各依韵奉答二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"思齐前烈扫边尘，龙卧贤豪世绝伦。\n祠下一时来展拜，隆中千古托交神。\n侯声道义终扶汉，公仗天威讨不臣。\n却忆纵擒多妙算，岂无灵感佑吾人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52498,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少保大司寇总制洪两峰先生隆中谒武侯兼承致前美建议立祠之意各依韵奉答二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"元戎肃谒武侯堂，山色隆中胜倍常。\n诗句唤醒尘世梦，酒杯引祝洞云傍。\n军师出将曾何忝，王佐抡才尚未忘。\n百代能逢几知己，野花岩谷尽情香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52499,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叠用屠司寇旧赠韵答钟舜臣少参","author":"林光","text":"军储百万附通儒，区画寻常见范模。\n宦辙春风连楚粤，诗怀秋月照江湖。\n忙如救火何堪缓，闻似知音敢谓无。\n高论几回曾洗耳，白头宁复怨江都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52500,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大司马刘东山老先生谪戍肃州遇赦放还经襄阳铁佛寺叙旧赋此奉赠","author":"林光","text":"万里生还楚水滨，相看真懒话缘因。\n戎衣谢拭三边泪，雨露初逢十月春。\n乡党又开新眼孔，头颅还是旧精神。\n谁云人定天难定，前席他年语尚闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52501,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠典簿史奈致仕还沁源","author":"林光","text":"幕下怜君勇乞身，归程刚好及初春。\n马骡相逐迎孙子，山水安排作主宾。\n混迹自堪忘势分，知几终不厌清贫。\n桑麻满地花红白，村酒时看酌野人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52502,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪岳台李别驾西泉曹侍御游岘石寺同次磨崖石刻诗韵二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"襄阳留滞笑南川，六载三过此洞天。\n春旱且看花蓓蕾，诗成刚遇酒神仙。\n大书欲放岩头笔，久渴思吞石罅泉。\n老去吾侪宽展步，任他边将勒燕然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52503,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪岳台李别驾西泉曹侍御游岘石寺同次磨崖石刻诗韵二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"步步扳岩望汉川，春波摇漾浸晴天。\n鹿门真见庞居士，家学还逢李谪仙。\n诗遇敌勍姑退舍，酒生消渴更烹泉。\n夕阳共借西颓景，非独今人古亦然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52504,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承国主命代祀西南二坛斋居偶成","author":"林光","text":"中灵耿耿见常川，祀典诸神鉴在天。\n魂梦清来如见帝，尘缘蜕尽似登仙。\n五风十雨祈丰岁，万姓三车足货泉。\n大事肃将何敢慢，试看豺獭性犹然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52505,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼介寿为都宪陈矩庵先生","author":"林光","text":"景会流钟地本灵，岳阳楼上拜辰星。\n天回花雪供南极，水涌鱼龙舞洞庭。\n已把莱衣文豸绣，伫看鸾诰炳丹青。\n都台赋有无穷意，吞吐湖山兴倍增。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52506,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德辛未二月陪都宪矩庵陈先生方伯管公少参白公佥宪陈公往隆中谒武侯二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"何处春风聚德星，卧龙踪迹迎郊坰。\n莺声催得花如锦，山色斜纡翠作屏。\n文教振扬非案牍，武威戡乱是雷霆。\n元戎举趾殊非偶，试听三军颂未停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52507,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德辛未二月陪都宪矩庵陈先生方伯管公少参白公佥宪陈公往隆中谒武侯二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"千年人仰几辰星，鼓吹连城动晓坰。\n野寺偶经新佛閤，灵祠深造旧云屏。\n伏龙奋迹归霄汉，□老□魂惮震霆。\n无限夕阳怀古意，深杯入手岂须停。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52508,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠人","author":"林光","text":"话别殷勤汉水涯，铜鞮歌罢更何疑。\n百年称意事偏少，三月争春绿已肥。\n好景每因忙处忽，醇醪须到醉时知。\n杜鹃声里花饶笑，忍见斜风故故吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52509,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵送罗柱举人 其一","author":"林光","text":"扶植纲常写腑肝，乃翁长夜去漫漫。\n孤舟梦觉宁安枕，千里归来早挂冠。\n乌帽却怜吾子肖，青春那许酒杯乾。\n汉江缭绕波千顷，三沐淹波一尽欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52510,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵送罗柱举人 其二","author":"林光","text":"归来自信有馀师，曾荷而翁过望期。\n襄汉话投君记取，湖西门径我能知。\n屋乌念洽三春酒，世路看慵几局棋。\n花落花开晴又雨，九原无雁慰吾思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52511,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨","author":"林光","text":"阴云欲合即生风，阳亢相将一月终。\n赤日行空煎伏暑，乾雷辗地跨长虹。\n田农束手嗟无计，禄吏轮诚冀感通。\n甘雨连宵忽沾足，闾阎諠笑望年丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52512,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洗心亭为华廷禧少参题","author":"林光","text":"心无可洗洗何功，敢把亭名一叩公。\n经史浇培灵府静，云山涤荡俗缘空。\n书涵珠宝尘埃外，夜抱银蟾天水中。\n万顷东溟真快意，未容解组郊龟蒙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52513,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"傅寺副双亲挽二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"江汉边头狱洗新，却因而子想而亲。\n弓遗已称悬门意，机断应怀旧日恩。\n原上邱坟封宿草，阶前兰玉长深春。\n不知从役京尘里，得受光荣有几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52514,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"傅寺副双亲挽二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"泉壤受恩原有自，薤歌枯笔发无从。\n寒霜不恨戎衣薄，夜月难忘手线重。\n一武一文儿有立，齐眉齐寿福先钟。\n且看荆楚来谳狱，遗有求生念未慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52515,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和内阁及大理诸公联句赠少司马德兴孙先生四首并序 其一","author":"林光","text":"春风开卷便酣人，传写都台语迫真。\n汉水未须催画舫，沙鸥应亦识名臣。\n流移总道郧阳好，节镇容知抚治仁。\n乾象夜深频属目，台星耿耿照微宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52516,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和内阁及大理诸公联句赠少司马德兴孙先生四首并序 其二","author":"林光","text":"一回骋望一登台，照耀郧江节龯来。\n每愧衰迟辜荐剡，却缘恩爱识真才。\n幽崖穷谷应留照，玉树冰壶绝照埃。\n已置人中仙在眼，枉寻石罅访天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52517,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和内阁及大理诸公联句赠少司马德兴孙先生四首并序 其三","author":"林光","text":"深夜铃驰两马声，山堂燃纸续灯明。\n诗评诸老舒还卷，翰染西涯瘦更清。\n身外勋名随世就，眼前花样岂公荣。\n丈夫嚬笑关时运，载祝赓歌入舜廷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52518,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和内阁及大理诸公联句赠少司马德兴孙先生四首并序 其四","author":"林光","text":"重地黎元赖抚安，眼中风景浩瀰漫。\n春经闾里花含笑，恩洽严慈诰已颁。\n声韵玉堂深雅望，丹青麟阁永何刊。\n南畿参佐閒机务，更把长篇子细看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52519,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访曹西泉侍御山居二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"见庞亭子念频年，匹马东风破晓烟。\n嫩绿已肥春恰暮，浓云初散日方妍。\n习池梦兆湖西叶，桂史声光斗北悬。\n宛转林花相掩映，谁知空谷有人仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52520,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访曹西泉侍御山居二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"两年雾雪变阳春，重地今真仰抚民。\n羽檄忽传徵去节，口碑聊听颂行人。\n肩舆拖驾双骡隐，岐路凉生一扇新。\n位渐高时恩渐溥，飞潜何处不容身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52521,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重九日登岘石洞岩次磨崖石刻古韵","author":"林光","text":"千仞悬崖俯汉川，衰年扶步若登天。\n茱萸晚日簪重九，乌帽斜风落醉仙。\n古怪岩头看剥字，清泠涧底认跑泉。\n摩挲盘石行还住，走笔题诗笑率然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52522,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高阳池候都宪李先生四首 其一","author":"林光","text":"春去夏复来，怀贤情未已。\n雨馀山正佳，汉水增浩瀰。\n溯回惊急湍，来舟进复止。\n望望鹿门山，众芳竞妍美。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52523,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高阳池候都宪李先生四首 其二","author":"林光","text":"至人无牵尼，行止自有时。\n未能测中蕴，信息满江湄。\n青阳亦易暮，风色未迟迟。\n徘徊洁豆觞，凝睇高阳池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52524,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高阳池候都宪李先生四首 其三","author":"林光","text":"骋目汉江湄，涨沙忽吞改。\n谁持造化机，一雨功十倍。\n岂无欲济心，忧在渔梁水。\n达人来拯溺，引领时相待。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52525,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高阳池候都宪李先生四首 其四","author":"林光","text":"转盼宇宙间，高才能几见。\n身轻囊易括，花落春空羡。\n绵绵忧世心，暮景来恩眷。\n风云在掌握，叱咤看雷电。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52526,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神泉为大参将钟君题四首 其一","author":"林光","text":"中冷尝一歃，已过惠泉甘。\n不遇贤藩佐，谁来发地藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神泉为大参将钟君题四首 其二","author":"林光","text":"泥沙埋自昔，嘉号得今传。\n未试真风韵，那知启自天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神泉为大参将钟君题四首 其三","author":"林光","text":"西来逢至喜，险尽黄牛庙。\n夷陵窥列宿，偶得感通妙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神泉为大参将钟君题四首 其四","author":"林光","text":"潜沂入地中，谁识真源处。\n谢却桔槔劳，为霖天上去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次岘山有感韵兼赠别陈佥宪","author":"林光","text":"暑雨连消岘首尘，殷勤杯酒可辞频。\n刑书动欲求生狱，心法那须问斲轮。\n瓜及一期应未晚，霜飞六月岂无春。\n画船箫鼓喧斜日，诗料江边处处新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"借通川感事诗韵寄林见素都宪兼呈总制洪两峰先生","author":"林光","text":"敌降谈笑据征鞍，胜敌何如自胜难。\n老眼浮云看一世，殊勋远地险千盘。\n边书罪己神灵护，颇蔺同心贼胆寒。\n料理元戎清况在，也留只字及南冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜李都宪以抚治督将出师用杜老诸将韵奉赠二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"贼骑纵横傍霍山，邻封唐汝尚牢关。\n土戎已壮官军胆，夷长远参将佐间。\n鱼在釜中犹戏跃，棋当局处却安閒。\n春风指日传飞捷，武弁知谁不厚颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜李都宪以抚治督将出师用杜老诸将韵奉赠二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"攻屠连拔十馀城，济北淮南骇贼旌。\n岂谓太平终偃武，却劳文士远提兵。\n汉思颇牧增长叹，世遇黄河几度清。\n多谢郧襄贤督府，直将恩信迓升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谷隐寺二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"晨装怯度鹿门津，谷隐西寻物色新。\n江水悬帆飞过客，莺花几树笑迎人。\n山藏洞口春随地，寺占盘窝草胜茵。\n醉倒松根眠枕石，懒将生灭说缘因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谷隐寺二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"晚雨肩舆入翠屏，鹿门形胜肖丹青。\n高低山抱春和气，上下泉通地脉灵。\n道眼何曾离笠影，瑞岩常自问翁惺。\n也知佳境偏难到，天与康强更几龄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹿门寺怀庞德公","author":"林光","text":"鹿门风致念经旬，几度怀贤欲访频。\n陇上辍耕闻好语，山中遗迹问何人。\n翠微夜雨来僧閤，红烛深杯话隐沦。\n多少英雄争战事，襄阳耆旧却输君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉赠李都宪以郧阳抚治升掌南都察院事","author":"林光","text":"五月长江水满时，活流风送到南畿。\n功成已见文兼武，名重应闻夏与夷。\n别酒共怜葵照日，占年刚对麦秋期。\n宦游他日寻遗迹，却笑吾诗是口碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别范邦秀节推转南京春曹","author":"林光","text":"袖拂西风起白蘋，暑馀初换一凉新。\n有官岂必惟科道，无欲终当见性真。\n南国同时多故旧，瓯闽垂老慰慈亲。\n春曹仪制非无事，莫遣乡情久滞人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉赠少保洪总制先生","author":"林光","text":"四藩瞻望将星高，经略山深军务劳。\n阃外齐威明即墨，淮西裴相净逋逃。\n村馀壁垒荆蒿长，兵洗岩林虎豹号。\n飞捷献俘天上去，臣民胥庆仰崇褒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"儗赠人","author":"林光","text":"骢马如龙锦覆鞍，路当西蜀岂辞难。\n令严却任霜加雪，机活应如珠走盘。\n寇盗从来多险阻，流亡多为逼饥寒。\n军门直笔功须纪，莫遣之推远挂冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52541,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别少参李岳台致政还家","author":"林光","text":"怜君巨眼隘中州，几度襄阳话喜投。\n山水称心居欲卜，宦途无味去难留。\n时危海内风尘满，岁晚林深倦翮休。\n归近重阳好时节，千杯菊酒洗閒愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52542,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往南川别墅舟中偶成","author":"林光","text":"海天使者忆胡奴，吏隐南川亦此都。\n雨久晴来山转翠，江深流急棹萦纡。\n杯盘指拟需重九，花草丁宁候菊萸。\n老我何心更争席，却于篷底羡鸥凫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52543,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游古林寺看珠泉","author":"林光","text":"胜地从来地秘灵，肩舆斜日眼还清。\n一泓泉喷珠玑涌，九月霜红树锦屏。\n旋汲烹茶尝水味，欲裁蕉叶写心经。\n丁宁行者前头拜，筑土周遭搆一亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52544,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月七日别墅池亭小酌","author":"林光","text":"亭子初看落暮霞，南川吏隐渐成家。\n重阳未至菊先放，春色争妍杏亦花。\n元亮饱飧香稻美，懒残常啖芋魁嘉。\n王官却任醺醺醉，天与精神寿日加。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52545,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其一","author":"林光","text":"菊开何太晚，重九已过时。\n款款来蜂蝶，幽香满短篱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52546,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其二","author":"林光","text":"几种重阳菊，连开傲晚霜。\n红黄各称赏，朵朵弄杯觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52547,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其三","author":"林光","text":"看到忘言处，浑疑我是花。\n不知时已过，犹复露霜葩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52548,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其四","author":"林光","text":"采采篱边菊，羞将插帽纱。\n却疑秋富贵，天地也奢华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52549,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其五","author":"林光","text":"庭中矮橘树，颗颗照金黄。\n却衬篱边菊，天然锦绮香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52550,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其六","author":"林光","text":"朵朵玉为盘，金黄向里攒。\n樽中欢酌尽，酒量不知宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52551,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其七","author":"林光","text":"胭脂红照日，花蕊簇金黄。\n暗有天香发，阿谁作主张。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52552,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其八","author":"林光","text":"庐山重九节，送酒有江州。\n不是陶元亮，花神枉献秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52553,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其九","author":"林光","text":"细卷鹅毛白，中留一点黄。\n倚栏看不厌，有句入诗囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52554,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬后赏菊十首 其十","author":"林光","text":"醴酝何曾乏，谁人遣白衣。\n叉头那未尽，时节酒非迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52555,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题郭总戎追思慈爱卷","author":"林光","text":"八十慈帏已去时，双垂鹤发正丝丝。\n被诬谁为开心镜，雪枉天教不死儿。\n累荷皇恩扶正气，屡传瓜瓞慰深思。\n满前春事无人会，喜对均阳细咏诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52556,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得趣亭自警","author":"林光","text":"人心灵更妙，易放实难收。\n悟得防閒计，专于敬上求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52557,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柏台春雨","author":"林光","text":"时雨连绵洗故城，绣衣当道典文衡。\n润回生意元无限，隔断红尘香不惊。\n寒透野花微有色，翠交庭草湿无声。\n愚生何幸沾恩泽，心捧水壶分外清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52558,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游圭峰","author":"林光","text":"瘦马独深入，高峰将尽头。\n造他真境界，是个小罗浮。\n火米兼僧饭，基茶煮涸流。\n无烦白沙念，禅客解相留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":52559,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]